proxilens (2.1.0~beta7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Document shared 15-minute, login-session-scoped authorization target for sudo and Polkit.
  * Specify explicit-only Ubuntu password fallback and cancel behavior.
  * Define trust boundaries and security gates for a future privileged policy service.
  * Keep all real system-authentication integration disabled; no PAM, Polkit or sudoers changes.

